msgid "The fabric could not be saved."
msgstr "Ba a iya adana fabric ɗin ba."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The fabric was saved."
msgstr "An adana fabric ɗin."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "A sweep of this fabric is running, so nothing was deleted. Try again when it finishes."
msgstr "Sharewar wannan fabric tana gudana, don haka ba a goge komai ba. Sake gwadawa idan ta gama."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The fabric and its inventory were deleted. No Cacti device was changed and the fabric was not contacted."
msgstr "An goge fabric ɗin da jerin kayayyakinsa. Ba a sauya wata na'urar Cacti ba kuma ba a tuntuɓi fabric ɗin ba."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The fabric could not be deleted."
msgstr "Ba a iya goge fabric ɗin ba."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The node identity was not changed."
msgstr "Ba a sauya shaidar node ɗin ba."

