msgstr "Fabric %s: babu wani node da aka taswira zuwa na'urar Cacti, don haka babu sharewar da ke farawa kuma ba a sabunta jerin kayayyakin ba. Taswira wani node a shafin Gudanar da Fabric, ko gudanar da \"php %s/plugins/fabric/fabric_sweep.php --fabric=%d --force\" a kan main poller."

