#: lib/InventoryPage.php
msgid "Transmit wait counts ticks in which a port had data to send but could not send it, for lack of credits or arbitration. A high value shows congestion toward the remote end; it does not show that the port or its cable is faulty. The tick length is not published for current link speeds, so values are ticks per second, not time."
msgstr "Jiran watsawa yana ƙirga ticks waɗanda tasha take da bayanan da za ta aika amma ba ta iya aika su ba, saboda rashin credits ko sulhu. Ƙima mai girma tana nuna cunkoso zuwa ɓangaren nesa; ba ya nuna cewa tashar ko wayarta tana da matsala. Ba a wallafa tsawon tick don saurin haɗi na yanzu ba, don haka ƙimomin ticks ne a kowace daƙiƙa, ba lokaci ba."

