#: lib/PrivilegeProbe.php
msgid "The sweep runs as root. Run the poller as an unprivileged account with read access to the umad devices through a group."
msgstr "Binciken yana gudana ne a matsayin root. Gudanar da mai tattara bayanai (poller) a matsayin asusun da ba shi da cikakken iko mai izinin karanta na'urorin umad ta hanyar rukuni."

#: lib/PrivilegeProbe.php lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "A diagnostics tool has the setuid or setgid bit. The plugin never needs it."
msgstr "Wani kayan aikin bincike yana da alamar setuid ko setgid. Kari (plugin) ba ya taɓa buƙatarsa."

#: lib/PrivilegeProbe.php
msgid "A diagnostics tool or its directory can be written by an account other than its owner, or by the poller account. Whoever can write it chooses what the poller runs."
msgstr "Wani asusu banda mai shi, ko asusun mai tattara bayanai (poller), yana iya rubutu a cikin kayan aikin bincike ko babban fayil ɗinsa. Duk wanda ke iya rubutu a cikinsa zai iya zaɓar abin da mai tattara bayanan zai gudanar."

#: lib/PrivilegeProbe.php
msgid "A umad device is readable or writable by every account, so any local user can query the fabric. Restrict it to a group."
msgstr "Kowane asusu yana iya karantawa ko rubutawa a na'urar umad, don haka kowane mai amfani na gida zai iya bincikar fabric ɗin. Takaita shi zuwa rukuni."

#: lib/PrivilegeProbe.php lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "Unknown warning"
msgstr "Gargaɗin da ba a sani ba"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Diagnostics Tools"
msgstr "Kayan Aikin Bincike"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute directory, on each poller that sweeps a fabric, holding perfquery, ibnetdiscover, and iblinkinfo. The Debian and Ubuntu packages install them in /usr/sbin. No other program is ever run from it."
msgstr "Cikakken babban fayil, a kan kowane mai tattara bayanai (poller) da ke bincikar fabric, wanda ke ɗauke da perfquery, ibnetdiscover, da iblinkinfo. Fakitocin Debian da Ubuntu suna girka su a /usr/sbin. Ba a taɓa gudanar da wani shiri daban daga cikinsa ba."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Tool Directory"
msgstr "Babban Fayil na Kayan Aiki"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node Name Map"
msgstr "Taswirar Sunan Kulli"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Optional absolute path to an infiniband-diags node name map file. Names it supplies are shown only; identity is always the node GUID."
msgstr "Cikakkiyar hanyar zaɓi zuwa fayil ɗin taswirar sunan kulli na infiniband-diags. Sunayen da yake bayarwa ana nuna su ne kawai; ainihin shaidar kulli ita ce GUID."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Datagram Timeout"
msgstr "Ƙarewar Lokacin Datagram"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Milliseconds each management datagram may take before the tools retry it (their -t option)."
msgstr "Milisekon da kowane datagram na gudanarwa zai iya ɗauka kafin kayan aikin su sake gwadawa (zaɓinsu na -t)."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Command Timeout"
msgstr "Ƙarewar Lokacin Umarni"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one tool run may take before it is stopped and recorded as failed."
msgstr "Daƙiƙoƙin da gudanarwar kayan aiki guda ɗaya za ta iya ɗauka kafin a tsayar da ita kuma a yi mata rajista a matsayin wadda ta gaza."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "KiB one tool run may print. Larger output is discarded and recorded as failed."
msgstr "Adadin KiB da gudanarwar kayan aiki guda ɗaya za ta iya bugawa. Fitowar da ta fi haka girma za a zubar da ita kuma a yi mata rajista a matsayin wadda ta gaza."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Output"
msgstr "Mafi Girman Fitarwa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Sweep"
msgstr "Bincike"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node Time Budget"
msgstr "Ƙayyadadden Lokacin Kulli"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one node sweep may spend reading counters. Ports not reached are read in the next cycle."
msgstr "Daƙiƙoƙin da binciken kulli guda ɗaya zai iya ɗauka wajen karanta ma'aunan ƙidaya. Tashoshin da ba a kai gare su ba za a karanta su a zagaye na gaba."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Failed ports after which a node sweep stops for this cycle. A port that does not answer costs several seconds."
msgstr "Adadin tashoshin da suka gaza waɗanda bayan su binciken kulli zai tsaya a wannan zagayen. Tasha da ba ta amsawa tana cin daƙiƙoƙi da yawa."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node Failure Budget"
msgstr "Ƙayyadadden Gazawar Kulli"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Index Down Ports"
msgstr "Yi Rajistar Tashoshin da Ba Sa Aiki"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, the Fabric Port data query also lists ports that are down and have no remote end, such as unused adapter ports. Cleared, they are left out until they come up."
msgstr "Idan an zaɓa, binciken bayanan Tashar Fabric zai kuma jero tashoshin da ba sa aiki kuma ba su da haɗi a ɗaya ƙarshen, kamar tashoshin mai daidaitawa da ba a amfani da su. Idan an cire zaɓin, za a bar su a waje har sai sun dawo aiki."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Cirewa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Riƙe Teburan Plugin yayin Cirewa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its fabrics, inventory, and samples. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them; export the inventory first from the Fabric Admin page. The fabric is never contacted either way."
msgstr "Idan an zaɓa, cire kari (plugin) zai adana fabric ɗinsa, ƙididdigar kayayyaki, da samfurori. Cire zaɓin domin cirewa ya goge su; fara fitar da ƙididdigar kayayyaki daga shafin Gudanarwar Fabric. Ba a taɓa tuntuɓar fabric ɗin a kowane hali ba."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory must be an absolute path of letters, digits, dots, dashes, underscores, and slashes, with no trailing slash."
msgstr "Babban fayil na kayan aiki dole ne ya zama cikakkiyar hanya mai ɗauke da haruffa, lambobi, ɗigo, gajerun layuka, layukan ƙasa, da sandunan giciye, ba tare da sandar giciye a ƙarshe ba."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory does not exist or is not a directory."
msgstr "Babban fayil na kayan aiki ba ya wanzu ko ba babban fayil ba ne."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory path contains a symbolic link. Enter the real path."
msgstr "Hanyar babban fayil na kayan aiki tana ɗauke da hanyar haɗi ta alama (symbolic link). Shigar da ainihin hanyar."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory is not owned by root."
msgstr "Babban fayil na kayan aiki ba mallakin root ba ne."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory can be written by its group or by others."
msgstr "Rukuninsa ko wasu suna iya rubutu a cikin babban fayil na kayan aiki."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "A diagnostics tool is not owned by root."
msgstr "Wani kayan aikin bincike ba mallakin root ba ne."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "A diagnostics tool can be written by its group or by others."
msgstr "Rukuninsa ko wasu suna iya rubutu a cikin wani kayan aikin bincike."

